COMPONENT BackupPayloadSerializer

SERIALIZE(schedules, accounts, budgets)
    validate item counts and required fields
    return PRIVATE_SERIALIZATION_IMPLEMENTATION.encode(schedules, accounts, budgets)

DESERIALIZE(payload)
    validate payload type, version, limits and required fields
    return PRIVATE_SERIALIZATION_IMPLEMENTATION.decode(payload)

NOTE
    The official payload structure, validation rules and migrations are intentionally omitted.
